#====================================================================
# E543-draft-B188 — PREFER_CONFIG=ON 使 exiv2 静态闭包的 EXPAT::EXPAT 解析失败
#====================================================================
id:                     E543
trigger_tool:           cmake|configure
phase:                  configuration
error_signature:        The link interface of target "[^"]*" contains:\s*EXPAT::EXPAT|EXPAT::EXPAT.*but the target was not found|IMPORTED target.*EXPAT::EXPAT

severity:               2
category:               cmake, build-system, compat, dependency
match_keywords:         CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG, EXPAT::EXPAT, exiv2Config.cmake, exiv2lib, expat-config.cmake, LINK_ONLY, find_dependency, imported target
title:                  PREFER_CONFIG=ON 时 conan 的 expat-config.cmake 只导出 expat::expat，exiv2 静态闭包 EXPAT::EXPAT 未定义

root_cause:             exiv2/0.28.x 的静态库导出 exiv2Config.cmake，其 exiv2Targets.cmake 把传递依赖写成
                        INTERFACE_LINK_LIBRARIES "$<LINK_ONLY:EXPAT::EXPAT>;$<LINK_ONLY:ZLIB::ZLIB>"（大写命名空间）。
                        这两个名字由 CMake 的模块模式 FindEXPAT/FindZLIB 创建；而 conan 的 expat 包安装的是上游
                        expat-config.cmake（只定义 expat::expat）。当配方设置 CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG=ON 时，
                        exiv2Config.cmake 内部的 find_dependency(EXPAT) 优先走 CONFIG 模式命中 expat-config.cmake，
                        EXPAT::EXPAT 始终不会被创建，generate 阶段即报 "link interface ... contains: EXPAT::EXPAT
                        but the target was not found"。ZLIB::ZLIB 通常仍能由模块模式 FindZLIB 兜底，因此只有 EXPAT
                        暴露该冲突。
affected_scope:         消费 exiv2（静态 libexiv2.a，EXIV2_ENABLE_XMP=ON）且在 conanfile.py 里显式设置了
                        CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG=ON 的 CMake 项目；libkexiv2 26.04.0 实测（本仓库
                        kfilemetadata 6.28.0 采用"不设置 PREFER_CONFIG + 预定义 EXPAT::EXPAT"的规避路径）。
verification_cmd:       cmake configure 日志中应无 "contains: EXPAT::EXPAT but the target was not found"；
                        若保留 PREFER_CONFIG=ON，可 grep 生成的 <build>/generators/conan_cmakedeps_paths.cmake 确认
                        已预定义 EXPAT::EXPAT。

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           avoid-prefer-config
rec_description:        不设置 CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG（保持默认模块优先），使 find_dependency(EXPAT) 命中
                        CMake 内置 FindEXPAT 并创建 EXPAT::EXPAT。上游项目里凡是需要 CONFIG 模式的 find_package
                        （如 find_package(Qt6 NO_MODULE)、find_package(exiv2 CONFIG)、find_package(ECM CONFIG)）
                        都显式写了模式参数，不受该变量影响。
rec_command:            从 conan_cmakedeps_paths.cmake 中移除 set(CMAKE_FIND_PACKAGE_PREFER_CONFIG ON)
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe-helper

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      inject-imported-target
fallback_description:   必须保留 PREFER_CONFIG=ON 时，在 toolchain 注入的 cmake 片段中按 conan expat 包实体预定义
                        EXPAT::EXPAT（kfilemetadata 6.28.0 先例），使 $<LINK_ONLY:EXPAT::EXPAT> 有目标可解析。
fallback_command:       片段: if(NOT TARGET EXPAT::EXPAT) add_library(EXPAT::EXPAT UNKNOWN IMPORTED); set_target_properties(EXPAT::EXPAT PROPERTIES IMPORTED_LOCATION "<expat-package>/lib/libexpat.so"); endif()
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          conan-recipe-helper

forbid_1_pattern:       修改.*exiv2Config\.cmake|patch.*exiv2-config\.cmake|删除.*find_dependency.*EXPAT
forbid_1_reason:        修改依赖包的安装产物属于越权改动，且会丢失 expat/zlib 传递依赖信息
forbid_1_consequence:   依赖包被污染影响其他消费者；链接期容易出现未定义符号或静默缺依赖

principles:

causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E473]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

